  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training Institute on Migration Capacity Partnership for the Mediterranean - II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The concrete objective of the project is to contribute to building migration capacity partnerships through the establishment of a permanent and accredited regional training institute offering quality-assured, bespoke learning and coaching experiences that result in certification for migration actors in line with global best practices for good governance. By doing so, the project aims to contribute to more effective administration of the movement of persons and goods and thus ultimately promoting the economic development and welfare of its Southern Partner Countries.</narrative>
  </description>
